:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Li'l Lion Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Cow Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] increases health, attack power, recharge time and gains [[Wave Attack|Wave]] Immunity. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

