==Trivia==
*Li'l Lion Cat's mane and tail are modeled after Pon de Lion, the iconic mascot of [[wikipedia:Mister Donut|Mister Donut]]. In fact, his Japanese description implies that his mane is just one of their signature [https://youtu.be/SnkbdVsQs5U pon de ring donuts].
*Along with [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)#Li'l Mohawk Cat|Li'l Mohawk Cat]], Li'l Lion Cat was the final Li'l Cat to receive Talents, only having received them in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].
*Li'l Lion Cat is one of the units to have its description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "Immune to wave damage" was changed to "Immune to Waves".

